+one per combination of mode and the `5v_out`, `12v_out`, and `20v_out` rails:
+
+```text
+builtin/maskrom/5v_out     builtin/edl/5v_out
+builtin/maskrom/12v_out    builtin/edl/12v_out
+builtin/maskrom/20v_out    builtin/edl/20v_out
+```
